{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24424","headline":"晚夏闲居绝无宾客欲寻梦得先寄此诗 · 白居易","name":"晚夏闲居绝无宾客欲寻梦得先寄此诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鱼笋朝餐饱，蕉纱暑服轻。\n欲爲窗下寝，先傍水边行。\n晴引鹤双舞，秋生蝉一声。\n无人解相访，有酒共谁倾。\n老更谙时事，闲多见物情。\n只应刘与白，二叟自相迎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24424.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24424","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}